Description: Material 3 authentication dialog for Kernora OS
 The prompt becomes a frameless card that draws its own rounded surface and
 shadow: the lock on a tonal circle, the headline and the reason centred, the
 account as a chip (a menu when there is a choice), the password in a pill,
 errors in the error colour under it, and text buttons with a filled OK.
 Colours and fonts come from the system colour scheme through Kirigami, so
 the agent needs no QML from other packages.
Author: Kernora Developers <developers@kernora.invalid>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-29
